# German texts of mujina-adapter-steam that Mujina Settings shows: Steam's name, its options and
# the titles of its checks. Compiled in (the descriptor's catalogs); `cargo xtask i18n-check`
# lists what is missing.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Mujina\n"
"Language-Team: German\n"
"Language: de\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "Allowed. Steam can show the name of the Wi-Fi network."
msgstr "Erlaubt. Steam kann den Namen des WLANs zeigen."

msgid "Correct the Wi-Fi icon in Steam"
msgstr "WLAN-Symbol in Steam korrigieren"

msgid "Declined for Mujina. Steam shows a connection without the network's name."
msgstr "Für Mujina abgelehnt. Steam zeigt eine Verbindung ohne den Namen des Netzwerks."

msgid "For Home and Library, the “game is starting” screen and the Wi-Fi icon. The port has no password: any program you run can control Steam through it (SECURITY.md)."
msgstr "Für Startseite und Bibliothek, den Bildschirm „Spiel wird gestartet“ und das WLAN-Symbol. Der Port hat kein Passwort: Jedes Programm, das du ausführst, kann Steam darüber steuern (SECURITY.md)."

msgid "Location is off in Windows. Steam shows a connection without the network's name."
msgstr "Standort ist in Windows aus. Steam zeigt eine Verbindung ohne den Namen des Netzwerks."

msgid "Location permission"
msgstr "Standortberechtigung"

msgid "Not asked yet. Windows asks the first time you enter Xbox mode."
msgstr "Noch nicht gefragt. Windows fragt beim ersten Wechsel in den Xbox-Modus."

msgid "Not needed: Mujina runs unpackaged."
msgstr "Nicht nötig: Mujina läuft ohne Paket."

msgid "Overlay shortcut"
msgstr "Overlay-Kürzel"

msgid "Steam Big Picture"
msgstr "Steam Big Picture"

msgid "Steam otherwise shows the Wi-Fi as disconnected. Also lets the device button open Steam's menus directly. Needs the debugging port."
msgstr "Sonst zeigt Steam das WLAN als getrennt. Lässt außerdem die Gerätetaste Steams Menüs direkt öffnen. Braucht den Debugging-Port."

msgid "Steam's debugging port"
msgstr "Steams Debugging-Port"

msgid "Use Steam's debugging port"
msgstr "Steams Debugging-Port nutzen"
